6px;"&gt;，8 月份美国消费者信心跌至&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/G32khdjZkJujIV2_oIyZ81dYtlFLRH3zVXrZ0Nwa5_tR5aFLprXIT5jv1TUADdM6Z9meNYPjgNrbjqtonir6jZycd93Z6kbD0G3ZIyE-af4NaqQSk3sgUlbYR3_MLQLmq94r_WTUtp_9GhLFyVTSb0MC2qE4qBRDcVcD5ykWL5S8XZS4XMJ5jiTFLJEgb3K8U0y-TSeTvXhPFeV7IdWcAr_oG_FBRByoIPXdkItvLOLmwaRjsRlOovjCYjdDZndu2U_OQktIVUZLZWe9JmDqM-SALf6TShxKEBO3a2HARDS1IP4wZ_9Gdg4jA44iPW8o-X0Xjs2ZO1VuCaHOlAdnhpu-UZ5rsxzXViyviGjDRnZLYbzHy05tvDlxFWTsqSM9FZk21u6WhA_yhQovRQPOYJZqH4TPRespx5bQ2sW8dzFnaXF1dvORds9nqtWnCqti3GznJi9y9pdJbSDVHPwntk93nlsa9rVuNPie28KZiLlxn0qmGAA5cSxN2_1-QoMWY7_tLYBsEm2ES8J8wJ778GvS-eE/gjyCXiSu5LL0V3kJ1aZRPPL6dtsjVJnX/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="由于前景恶化，美国消费者信心跌至七个月低点"&gt;年初以来的最低水平&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;周二公布的数据显示，美国大型企业联合会信心指数较上月下调后下降 0.8 点至 89.4。尽管当前状况指标升至四个月高点，但对未来六个月的预期指标却跌至一月份以来的最低水平。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;报告显示， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/mUqF-W6fDMHhqJgtjTcvWqOyjNfNji5Yuugl0K8dAbMs2-dY9yJaqOTGrBWXnGkgNNncGqY3BOLMML7ceThX8OkiZFragcrXijgWN7zIwC91POQFgj4G_oCInppbvP26zPD619bFQTtkZQEagHf8IbF5uitKOLdl-nt0xVUMBV38UNY15N2-ZRYHCga7lQYsdLFRp-aMsTaJoSuowLiSUpksXDVIw1MvCj6wP3j7vDwhLBAlO2ipgChxUYu5ciDuVHMmY-QIFhJ2cRgqCHa8ELHKhZ7jo85PiVuSPvmuImMuVN63tBPF83bR0OChK0Ta-vKr4WfSJ0AXo_nlXAF_bJm3uZLFEoj24OcD0a_JkU7dbSEouke0xFBuQUrkI-6bmYfueh5rIV7LXEoOJvdWoSlvPoWnm-i8UoYaE8UzXKWy1AA9uw3EkLsSVLTJrHPtiSdcRotSe9sqcsQXS-ewQ9ZL3jaErNKNyYcpLptTwNNcXr3d8mdWtEZefqhHH8ziqoG3IpuFI2baFfN1G5-XPpuTJF6jGOw/KKEywKVmW3eZXSodHL1WMmS-AFMTTd1P/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="美国人从来没有在今年这么晚的时候为燃油支付过这么多钱"&gt;高油价&lt;/a&gt;、更广泛的生活成本压力以及招聘放缓，本月继续给美国家庭带来压力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/D8Ev5iMfQylG95SJok48tlUs7XStHqLQMOdDhoXmrPYX-fFtRqNHhuoRcXDnDPWm4ixsBQnW_QFuCZ