rit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="微软AI业务集中在OpenAI、TikTok、Meta"&gt;今天的《Tech In Depth》杂志&lt;/a&gt;上报道，机器人公司最近在中国的两场重大活动中展示了他们最新的人形模型。她写道，虽然机器人可以比以前跑得更快、跳得更高，但它们仍然没有掌握使它们成为日常生活一部分的有用任务。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ltYNRpY4DPeoh-ZPLBEOqtlHFTZVE53yTDG3HkGOTdA3zznxG-m6TqrQpPY22zUzxNoSJB8V5G9CFk3WJiiSVKjka1J1OBgG56xU6pxb8VMaQuh8AHodNq0oOBJkCQwVC6J9S2ftnhdb234oLsYOo8rh_uHKvcDoAe-48TrQ_k8ng7eidoBW31IPn0YN5G4AdTfHGO7WtpRTH_3p8nUPgkCELSFj0pNCP0gmoU4s2XWZfL0IqASS6_CDhNvFzTYR66kXXQXNhbQe1V-CRxcelxTr0FIusezgTsP0dLt733DWaWlImpIvPFRBGBdy3AyxK5xN5hJ0awejJe7As9pngpvN71ArelI9fkBDA3OHUS2FFjofYjGQGCxLnwB0ZuG-cS_g4Auv6Bzh3z5im-ZtpfcSj58RgYXipth8_23kqDtRcpBc6KV6duGyUvt5uqDJ-BXnydEe9uzgUSWGzXOsDnGL69kXaXP_3dcjYw1hAA/bvSeuj-ItBtfFVx3vPO5F7LeQfxQ-EhE/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="技术深度"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;获取《Tech In Depth》时事通讯&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;，了解彭博社世界各地记者对技术业务的分析和独家报道。&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;本周开机&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;马克·古尔曼 (Mark Gurman) 在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ZlU5iOOskIqYUUgfdeZ3e9-LDVH9Hpybahvk4NtIjki5ZrMcRTfokT-saFR27Qju4VSvoDth-sQ3hvWAeaL7_PftD10RR0i3VKBGGk-v8bioa7ihDgkNbdq7IrcRYSysWolAg4nZx91p9HPHKLTCnvtCsFG6slNW8xw1wD7L03NSzDqzwk_0FzZow-_A1z3aXv_27SltEkFgcXmmasUDqcSFEgSv7t-EyQtF9VpF7Cgkjms8ZlQWp3V9kmFAOjWJyUCHTrLwulS4iML4wqYtLtmYrzDbF0_IxWUg9BklfViimEZwRMXXWmC5qSbGlOgXgla_iguvVrd8oYepH7mKzJlDDcjJFGnzX8uz5xZAihAksfG8ynB6A3cY4fkWz19X9-TDw_vSSHVCGzOs3MWPshErQMmHYkakL6GU_Sl1NmJM7NSp0TTSOSsQyKqXoZZXFs7aWn7uVzcLpxoy9GTAxAfn69BnJeiJaKWluLwvYQF57XijUqXYorqjuXf0hm01wVFFlSWDqglFLTpKtgOQy1BtiFhjibJpRTcmlxJX6t21SGzjxXLpXcSYlu5zBdOgmOipGqkVNiUG8j3a4g/u0FHhobXZnIb2mH1h9IlGLUnH7E-Fe3I/24" r