;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="立即观看" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iuquhjMLDeIY/v0/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;看看&lt;em style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;现在谁在购买美国债务？&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr style="border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 24px;" /&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;像艾莉森·施拉格这样的邦德毁灭者&lt;/strong&gt;已经&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/KnVtyL6t-JuG45NmzbHo6hfyfcfDocesbUNg1d3qou0PqBnZH4AO2-ResoN6Y0S0bIjckHl8B2p5N8ZFGXcWbQ7Jd2clD7ozmCf_F6lBLh3Z0I24o42lGXG0S77sdjv661nMs1ADaIIAuLdK6ET6LL-LjjHLB7CZm9X4ipfJBOqOB58iFRaxzBpxAensAdY_tZLwDTolegUHtdfizakwIU93xbhWXsK2MkC6ktLd4GIhzXkN4qsHHrA7lVJ9q_mhPDb1n2duqKHWuK5oPRul5G9w38zfw0mT_lBTjhUufQe2cpo0EmnjHp9rzj4LGc24VbBS-xyItOlsS0HN9T3hOyG5lrcIfkZkR8Ao5DbGssQWtc7b7S8MxmudQBUaA-OoOoklka78l8JNd8KYsp5BhDbsawMP6yegnGLEQ-lAB2JX_qwAcGIANpQ52CpAifOmwF6WGkcKfWHKgHnEtWkmKt1kNc4MIlO49aQwWzJEeSx5itxjPlHHags3OK7JXzSKPRgAOwU0LVSevcTzCq-J1avTjVZg/8WabLV3jOPGcSjSZ-6xGUVmI0YuoJ0XH/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="当心债券市场的泡沫"&gt;等待这一刻&lt;/a&gt;15年了。但她在&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;彭博社观点&lt;/em&gt;中写道，这些观点尚未得到证实。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;上周 30 年期美国债券收益率突破 5%，为金融危机前以来的最高水平。财政部购买债券试图降低收益率，它奏效了&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/9KfA1Pui2cc69cPcnxYeiuQZdx_nFnDJSdcNXc1HAHR7hsU-0ofs4lzAC0MhAE85sIGdWGczKZlvQQRiuPJtFnF8EVMGpoFdH3GPAUAsZFP5DbkdvoIdIL0U19xAu6Jxg8Tu-D3067omWBB8yJBUR6pBXI8EtdAB3GP5KcQOJvw35r4WStsfBCu6-d60Ta6vb6hb_KjXWqBqyB5ctgpQ-GD_nQggt2pITucU7FHIjPxY9RW0vIR8pfpFLCCZcR16olB6Z44ibH3z9DOJcuaJaNU4S6dLP6Gx7v1KlesxiJMbxNgipOO1E8asP2hIXih9JtKlE7uFwNCGlw0X6BNPCvX0